Dear Investor, RITESH KISHOR SONAVNE - XWHIL With reference to collateral report at client level submitted to the Clearing Corporations. Information pertaining to your collateral as reported by your stock broker Date ending 30/05/2026 reported by Kotak Securities Ltd. are attached. Please follow the procedure given below for opening the attachment: Click on the attachment provided with this mail. You will be prompted for your password. The password is your PAN number in upper case. In case you find any discrepancy, we advise you to take up the matter immediately with your Member. The data reported for the date 30/05/2026 is provided to you in your registered mobile no. 9325582221 through SMS in summarized form and rounded to nearest rupee based on data uploaded by the member. The above details is provided by the member and data is being provided to the clients on "as is" and "where-is" basis, without any warranty. The Exchange shall not be liable for any delay or any other interruption which may occur in providing the data due to any reason including network (Internet) reasons or snags in the system, break down of the system or any other equipment, server breakdown, maintenance shutdown, breakdown of communication services or inability of the Exchange to send the data. In no event shall the Exchange be liable for any damages, losses or without limitation direct, special, incidental or consequential damages, losses or expenses arising in connection with the data provided by the Exchange through this facility. To Know More about Investor Awareness, Click here: &nbsp; SEBI Investor Awareness Website To Watch Video on SEBI Registered Investment Advisor, Click here: &nbsp; Video -SEBI Registered Investment Advisor Thanks and Regards, MCX Inspection & Audit "Disclaimer: The information contained in this e-mail (which includes any files transmitted with it) is CONFIDENTIAL, PROPRIETARY and is intended solely for the addressee(s) which may constitute PRIVILEGED information.
